[2.560, "o", "==========================================================================================\r\nTHE RULEBOOK NAMES THE FILING, SO THE RESPONSE IS WRITTEN\r\n==========================================================================================\r\n  2058 LAFAYETTE AVENUE, BRONX\r\n  job 201204268/03  permit PL seq 05  expires 2026-10-14\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    Job 201204268/03 permit PL seq 05 at 2058 LAFAYETTE AVENUE, BRONX expires October\r\n    14, 2026. The work is plumbing for new building at PS138X. Renew in DOB NOW: Build\r\n    or eFiling before the expiry date. A renewal without change goes through eFiling by\r\n    the permit applicant; a renewal with change requires a completed PW2 at a borough\r\n    office. https://www.nyc.gov/site/buildings/property-or-business-owner/permit-\r\n    renewal.page\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n  status: awaiting_approval    evidence: permit:3993563:due:FILE\r\n\r\n==========================================================================================\r\nAND WHERE A FACT IS MISSING, IT ASKS INSTEAD\r\n==========================================================================================\r\n"]
