[0.000, "o", "  job 340111765/01  permit PL seq 09  expired 2026-05-29, 108 days ago\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    Was any plumbing work done on this site after the permit expired? If nothing was\r\n    done, DOB waives the unpermitted work penalty and this is a clean renewal. If work\r\n    continued, the penalty has to be paid before the renewal can be issued at all.\r\n\r\n  status: needs_decision    no send button exists on this one\r\n"]
